        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of the Philippines, The NorthCap University, Ateneo de Manila University\n- Places: Philippines, Gurugram, Haryana, India\n- People: Nicanor Tiongson\n- Concepts: state university system, autonomous university, academic degrees\n\nFacts:\n- The University of the Philippines is a state university system in the Philippines.\n- The NorthCap University, formerly called ITM University, is an autonomous university in Sector 23-A, Gurugram, Haryana, India.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned a Bachelor of Humanities degree from Ateneo de Manila University.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned M.A. and Ph.D. degrees in Philippine Studies from the University of the Philippines.",
